## 2.1.6.3

- Added shared drawing with solo and team modes and expanded Pictionary.
- Added more live reactions and improved TV position-sync controls. Watch Party chat now supports removing your reactions and deleting permitted messages.
- Improved login storage reliability.

## 2.1.6.2

- Redesigned Friends and Watch Party pages with a more compact dashboard.
- Added the **React Live** hotbar and matched in-game reaction icons and colours to chat. Reactions can appear near the sender’s on-screen position.

## 2.1.6.1

- Improved 4K interface scaling and window resizing.
- Refreshed Home and Add Media layouts and improved browsing and subscriptions for YouTube and Internet Archive.
- Added clearer broadcasting controls and Patreon access guidance while keeping solo playback available.

## 2.1.6.0

- Improved TV startup when joining a party, viewer startup for Game Boy Advance broadcasts and the host’s DJ visualiser.
- Choosing ordinary playback keeps you on the media page you’re browsing.

## 2.1.5.9

- Added NES and Game Boy Advance support and improved the retro game library and controls.
- Added an embedded browser with favourites, history, privacy controls and an in-game TV view.
- Added a dedicated Mini Player and improved how current media carries over when starting a Watch Party.
- Added encrypted local login storage and clearer sign-in recovery.
